  ('W000001', 'ສະບາຍດີ', 'sa(ʔ˧˥).baːj˩(˧).diː˩(˧)', 'sa-baai-dii', 'ສະ|ບາຍ|ດີ', 'high-rising|low-rising|low-rising', 'high/dead/short/none→13|mid/live/long/none→2|mid/live/long/none→2', 'interjection; verb', null, null, null, null, 'hello; to be well', 1, 'greetings', '30', 1, 'C06|C14|C08|C09', 'V01|V03|V05', 'ສະ is short and clipped. baai rhymes with ''bye'' but is held longer, and dii is ''dee''; both start low and rise.', 'SRC-WIKT:ສະບາຍດີ', 'verified', null),
